\bibitem{sample_ecg_data}
Dataset: sample\_ecg.
\newblock \texttt{sample\_ecg} is a subset of the human STRING network (version
  12.0) with interaction scores of 900 or higher. Vertex IDs are Entrez Gene
  IDs (see Carlson, 2019). The network has been trimmed to create a smaller,
  more manageable example for the package's vignettes and tests. Source:
  string-db.org. Data from STRING is licensed under CC BY 4.0., 2025.

